Select the GIC interrupt group from the CPU pending signal

A pending Group 0 timer interrupt can appear in the CPU interface while the CPU signals IRQ. Probe for a matching FIQ signal with exceptions masked, and route the timer and scheduler SGI through Group 1 when Group 0 does not signal FIQ.

